ve put the Seattle Sounders (10th) on the brink of the club=E2=80=99s secon=
d missed postseason =E2=80=93 they need a win against Los Angeles FC.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Minnesota United (12th) staved off elimina=
